# Yuna, Hope of Spira, on the opponent's turn. Set up as the first scenario: Yuna's end-step trigger returns the Spirit of the
# Labyrinth with a finality counter. On turn 4 (Bot2's) it is not Bot1's turn, so neither Yuna nor the Spirit has trample, lifelink
# or ward {2}: Bot2's Bolt, with no ward to pay, resolves and kills the Spirit, and the finality counter exiles it instead of
# putting it into the graveyard (CR 122.6, 614.1).

